      <h2 id="home-takeaways-heading" class="takeaways-heading">Evidence-Based Dermatological Testing &amp; Research Standards</h2>
      <ul class="takeaways-list">
        <li class="takeaways-item">
          <span class="takeaways-bullet-icon" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
          <div><strong>Transepidermal Water Loss (TEWL) Benchmark:</strong> All top-rated barrier formulations must demonstrate &ge;35% reduction in TEWL within 4 hours using calibrated Tewameter hex-probe devices.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="takeaways-item">
          <span class="takeaways-bullet-icon" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
          <div><strong>Follicular Comedogenicity Scoring:</strong> Products claiming non-comedogenicity are screened via human repeat insult patch testing (HRIPT) and follicular biopsy to maintain scores between 0 and 1.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="takeaways-item">
          <span class="takeaways-bullet-icon" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
          <div><strong>Broad-Spectrum &amp; HEV Protection:</strong> Mineral sunscreens evaluated in our lab require spectrophotometric verification of UVA1/UVA2 attenuation and High Energy Visible (HEV) blue light shielding.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

