    <section class="comparison-section" id="sunscreen-comparison" aria-labelledby="sunscreen-comparison-heading">
      <div class="comparison-header">
        <span class="comparison-badge">Dermatological Decision Matrix</span>
        <h2 id="sunscreen-comparison-heading">Compare Top 3 Featured Sunscreens: Active Ingredients &amp; Target Skin Types</h2>
        <p>
          Not every UV filter or vehicle suits every dermal profile. Compare active photoprotective filters, primary dermatological actives, target skin concerns, and texture finishes to find your ideal daily sun protection in seconds.
        </p>
